      "content": "but it doesn't feel like something that can be \"fixed\" or \"moved forward\" from. it feels permanent. like i've basically poisoned something that was supposed to be good. how do you even reconcile that? how do you live with knowing you're the reason people are suffering? i just feel like i'm a walking error that shouldn't be here anymore.",
